# Applies to libEmuSC commit f503c9be3368370920055472599af9f2df78f623.
#
# This enables the single-part build used by RGSC55, adds the EMUSC_NO_REVERB
# and EMUSC_NO_CHORUS switches the unit builds with, renders the SC-55 stream in
# 64-sample sub-blocks so a host block never takes a whole control period's work,
# and fixes incompatibilities with the drumlogue SDK's ARM C++ standard library/
# compiler and loader.
