+
+// SC-55 samples are rendered in sub-blocks of this size. Control updates still
+// fire every 256 samples, but a small sub-block keeps each host block's work
+// short: the whole 256-sample burst no longer lands in a single render call.
+#define EMUSC_SUB_BLOCK 64
+
